From: Meizu 16th Plus mainline bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: add Meizu 16th Plus

Add the Meizu 16th Plus (M1892), an SDM845 handset, to the Qualcomm
root-compatible list.  Without this entry the board DT compiles, but
`CHECK_DTBS=y` rejects `meizu,m1892` at the root node.

---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -970,6 +970,7 @@ properties:
               - lenovo,yoga-c630
               - lg,judyln
               - lg,judyp
+              - meizu,m1892
               - oneplus,enchilada
               - oneplus,fajita
               - qcom,sdm845-mtp
-- 
2.43.0
